Output out.mp4
Set Width 3840
Set Height 2160
Set Theme { "background": "#161718", "foreground": "#F4F4F5", "cursor": "#F86606", "selection": "#3D3F43", "black": "#161718", "white": "#F4F4F5" }
Set FontSize 32
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Sleep 1s
Type `apify call apify/instagram-scraper -i '{"username":["humansofny"]}'`
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 4.84s